plete:p009","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete","quote":"胤"}],"identity_note":"廬江國子祭酒何胤抗表還會稽，朏胤連徵不屈同一兩人；registry未見同人，胤皆省稱何胤，不合何胤與朏或其他胤。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete-ws2044621","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0004"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0004","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0004"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangsengyou-ws1752646","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0123"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0123","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0123"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete-ws2044621","s-nanshi-021-wangsengyou-ws1752646"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi041-heyin-hedian","subject_person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","object_person_id":"rff_oam_3my","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"胤兄點","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"rff_oam_3my","younger_person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete-ws2044621","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009","quote":"　　胤兄點，亦遁節清信。顒與書，勸令菜食。曰：「丈人之所以未極遐蹈，或在不近全菜邪？脫灑離析之討，鼎俎網罟之興，載之簡策，其來寔遠。誰敢干議？觀聖人之設膳脩，仍復爲之品節，蓋以茹毛飲血，與生民共始，縱而勿裁，將無畔。善爲士者，豈不以恕己爲懷？是以各靜封疆，罔相陵軼。況乃變之大者，莫過死生；生之所重，無踰性命。性命之於彼極切，滋味之在我可賒，而終身朝晡，資之以永歲，彼就冤殘，莫能自列，我業久長，吁哉可畏。且區區微卵，脆薄易矝，歂彼弱麑，顧步宜衄。觀其飲喙飛沈，使人憐悼，況可心心撲褫，加復恣忍吞嚼。至乃野牧盛羣，閉豢重圈，量肉揣毛，以俟枝剝，如土委地，僉謂常理，可爲愴息，事豈一塗。若云三世理誣，則幸矣良快，如使此道果然，而受形未息，則一往一來，一生一死，輪迴是常事。雜報如家，人天如客，遇客日尠，在家日多，吾儕信業，未足長免，則傷心之慘，行亦自及。丈人於血氣之類，雖無身踐，至於晨鳧夜鯉，不能不取備屠門。財貝之一經盜手，猶爲廉士所棄；生性之一啓鸞刀，寧復慈心所忍。騶虞雖飢，非自死之草不食，聞其風豈不使人多愧。衆生之稟此形質，以畜肌膋，皆由其積壅癡迷，沈流莫反，報受穢濁，歷苦酸長，此甘與肥，皆無明之報聚也。何至復引此滋腴，自汙腸胃。丈人得此有素，聊復寸言發起耳。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0004"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"何點是何胤兄。周顒致點書。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"點","kind":"person","person_id":"rff_oam_3my","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete"},{"start":123,"end":125,"surface":"何點","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0123","person_id":"rff_oam_3my","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作點。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-qi041-heyin-hedian","subject_person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","object_person_id":"rff_oam_3my","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"胤兄點","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"rff_oam_3my","younger_person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete-ws2044621","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009","quote":"　　胤兄點，亦遁節清信。顒與書，勸令菜食。曰：「丈人之所以未極遐蹈，或在不近全菜邪？脫灑離析之討，鼎俎網罟之興，載之簡策，其來寔遠。誰敢干議？觀聖人之設膳脩，仍復爲之品節，蓋以茹毛飲血，與生民共始，縱而勿裁，將無畔。善爲士者，豈不以恕己爲懷？是以各靜封疆，罔相陵軼。況乃變之大者，莫過死生；生之所重，無踰性命。性命之於彼極切，滋味之在我可賒，而終身朝晡，資之以永歲，彼就冤殘，莫能自列，我業久長，吁哉可畏。且區區微卵，脆薄易矝，歂彼弱麑，顧步宜衄。觀其飲喙飛沈，使人憐悼，況可心心撲褫，加復恣忍吞嚼。至乃野牧盛羣，閉豢重圈，量肉揣毛，以俟枝剝，如土委地，僉謂常理，可爲愴息，事豈一塗。若云三世理誣，則幸矣良快，如使此道果然，而受形未息，則一往一來，一生一死，輪迴是常事。雜報如家，人天如客，遇客日尠，在家日多，吾儕信業，未足長免，則傷心之慘，行亦自及。丈人於血氣之類，雖無身踐，至於晨鳧夜鯉，不能不取備屠門。財貝之一經盜手，猶爲廉士所棄；生性之一啓鸞刀，寧復慈心所忍。騶虞雖飢，非自死之草不食，聞其風豈不使人多愧。衆生之稟此形質，以畜肌膋，皆由其積壅癡迷，沈流莫反，報受穢濁，歷苦酸長，此甘與肥，皆無明之報聚也。何至復引此滋腴，自汙腸胃。丈人得此有素，聊復寸言發起耳。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete:p009:m0004"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"何點是何胤兄。周顒致點書。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[{"older_person_id":"rff_oam_3my","younger_person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","assertion_id":"a-qi041-heyin-hedian","person_id":"vb0_ehz_mxj","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zh