hu-041-zhouyong-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-041-zhouyong-complete-ws2044621"},{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004","text":"稍遷晉安王文學，而陳郡袁利爲友，時人以爲妙選。齊武帝數閱武，僧佑獻講武賦，王儉借觀不與。竟陵王子良聞其工琴，於座取琴進之，不從命。永明末，爲太子中舍人，在直屬疾，不待對人輒去。中丞沈約彈之云：「肆情運氣，不顧朝典，揚眉闊步，直轡高驅。」坐贖論。時何點、王思遠之徒請交，並不降意。自天子至於侯伯，未嘗與一人遊。卒于黃門郎。子籍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":11,"end":13,"surface":"袁利","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0011","person_id":"kdf_yd6_q09","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作利。"},{"start":30,"end":32,"surface":"僧佑","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0030","person_id":"p93_tgr_t8r_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作佑。"},{"start":37,"end":39,"surface":"王儉","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0037","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作儉。"},{"start":47,"end":49,"surface":"子良","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0047","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作子良。"},{"start":90,"end":92,"surface":"沈約","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0090","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作約。"},{"start":123,"end":125,"surface":"何點","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0123","person_id":"rff_oam_3my","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作點。"},{"start":126,"end":129,"surface":"王思遠","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0126","person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作思遠。"},{"start":161,"end":162,"surface":"籍","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p004:m0161","person_id":"p93_tgr_t8r_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作籍。